{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 47, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to Nippon awaits\nA schedule wrought in verse to seal thy fates.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo's Grand Embrace**\n\nFrom skies afar thy vessel doth descend\nTo Narita's gate a new adventure to attend.\nA taxi swift shall guide thee through the haze\nTo Shinjuku's heights where neon light displays.\nA hotel chosen fit for noble men\nTo rest thy weary limbs and rise again.\nThen wander forth in Shinjuku's bustling core\nAnd taste the ramen flavors evermore.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa town a temple we shall roam\nSenso-ji's gates a spiritual home.\nWith incense sweet and prayers upon the breeze\nA glimpse of old Japan among the trees.\nThen Ueno Park where museums softly lie\nAnd art and history meet the watchful eye.\nIn Akihabara's realm of gadgets bright\nExplore the wonders bathed in digital light.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nFrom Tokyo's sprawl to Hakone we shall flee\nA mountain haven for thee and for me.\nBy lake Ashi we'll cruise a scenic ride\nWith views of Fuji's peak in glorious pride.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a wondrous sight\nWhere sculptures grace the hills in morning light.\nA volcanic hot spring a soothing balm\nTo ease thy travel woes and keep thee calm.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nUpon the Shinkansen a swift train we'll ride\nTo Kyoto's heart where ancient glories hide.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream\nA thousand torii a vibrant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera's temple stands so tall\nA wooden stage embracing one and all.\nGion's district where geishas softly tread\nA world of elegance secrets softly said.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shimmering grace\nReflecting in the pond a tranquil space.\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a mystic art\nTo ponder life's mysteries and play a part.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so green\nA whispered forest a peaceful scene.\nNijo Castle where shoguns held their sway\nA testament to power of yesterday.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara town where friendly deer reside\nIn Nara Park they roam with joyful stride.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA bronze behemoth in this ancient land.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nA pathway lit with mystical light.\nReturn to Kyoto as the day descends\nAnd memories of beauty gently blend.\n\n**Day Seventh Departure From Japan**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid this land farewell\nA journey ended a story to tell.\nFrom Kansai Airport thy vessel takes its flight\nBearing treasures of Japan in golden light.\nUntil we meet again in lands afar\nMay fortune smile upon thee like a star.\nFarewell dear traveler thy sojourn done\nMay peace and joy forever be won.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009858490899205208}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.24368974566459656}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.6197612285614014}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.02069265954196453}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.46532154083251953}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.5214525461196899}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.39122745394706726}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.008499992080032825}, {"token": "▁schedule", "logprob": -0.8663124442100525}, {"token": "▁wrought", "logprob": -3.3120791912078857}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.019339805468916893}, {"token": "▁verse", "logprob": -0.0009478605352342129}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.39328834414482117}, {"token": "▁seal", "logprob": -0.8141641020774841}, {"token": "▁thy", "logprob": -0.24002403020858765}, {"token": "▁fates", "logprob": -0.0003178806509822607}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.04758026450872421}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.00035375059815123677}, {"token": "**", 